<h2 id="新手与专家思维区别">新手与专家思维区别</h2>
<p><img src="https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/zhangxingong/blog@main/static/img/16-11-26_3_screenshot.png" alt="16-11-26_3_screenshot.png"></p>
<p>》》从总体出发</p>
<h2 id="stage-1-novice">Stage 1: Novice</h2>
<p><img src="https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/zhangxingong/blog@main/static/img/16-17-14_3_screenshot.png" alt="16-17-14_3_screenshot.png"></p>
