<h3 id="特点">特点</h3>
<blockquote>
<p>Novices don’t particularly want to<br>
learn; they just want to accomplish an immediate goal. They do<br>
not know how to respond to mistakes and so are fairly vulnerable<br>
to confusion when things go awry.</p>
</blockquote>
